    "intro_html":  "Pastitsio is Greece\u0027s answer to lasagna: cinnamon-kissed beef sauce, pasta, and a thick golden bechamel baked into sliceable layers. It is the biggest, richest bake on our board, with \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e per serving for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Sunday-project cooking that pays you back all week.",
